# =============================================================
# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages redirect rules (free hosts).
# Keeps internal documentation out of the public site and sends
# anyone who lands on a wrong URL to the branded 404 page, which
# still offers Call + WhatsApp.
# =============================================================
/marketing/*            /404.html   404
/README.md              /404.html   404
/SECURITY.md            /404.html   404
/DOMAIN.md              /404.html   404
/domains/*              /404.html   404
/set-url.sh             /404.html   404
/*.bak                  /404.html   404
